{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of a plain desktop?<br>Bring your screen to life with <strong>My Neko Pet</strong>, your adorable and playful digital cat companion!<br>My Neko Pet is a living, breathing digital pet that plays right on your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your mouse to guide Neko\u2019s gaze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag Neko with the left mouse button to move it around.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While dragging, use the mouse wheel to resize Neko.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on Neko to interact and see its reactions.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4161550?t=1768305322","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161550/d42c0a603f87ed52719a53b8efc7aaa912df559c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768305322","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161550/fbeb301f07aafec6829bf5b06f32e548ebd523bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768305322","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161550/fbeb301f07aafec6829bf5b06f32e548ebd523bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768305322","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of a plain desktop?<br>Bring your screen to life with <strong>My Neko Pet</strong>, your adorable and playful digital cat companion!<br>My Neko Pet is a living, breathing digital pet that plays right on your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your mouse to guide Neko\u2019s gaze